        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4 Notwithstanding the provisions of Paragraph 3, it is agreed that an Employee in a particular Work Location need not be Laid-Off if the forward work load at that location indicates that the Employee of longer Term of Employment who would otherwise be transferred to that location to take the place of the Employee Laid-Off would have to be Laid-Off within a period of six (6) months.",
