        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7 A former Employee who has been Laid-Off shall be returned to work in the inverse order of Layoff (except as provided in Paragraph 9) at the Base Location from which he or she was Laid-Off provided he or she makes himself or herself locally available to said Base Location, and provided that he or she is qualified for the work to be done, physically fit, and has not been Laid-Off for more than three (3) years.",
